  "plain": "A congressman named Schiff is said to have found that all the archive records on Roswell had been deleted. Roswell is the 1947 New Mexico case in which the military is said to have recovered a crashed craft. A guest named James Fox repeats this on the show, saying Schiff \"noted that all of the Roswell stuff was deleted, all the archival material,\" which, if true, would mean the official paper trail was wiped."
